 to have cut ties  with Jojo just like her big sister  Mackenzie didn't attend Jojo sweet 16  celebration and she hasn't posted any  pictures with her for almost two years  but we can't exactly blame her because  it's possible that Jojo through some  serious shade Kenzie's way Jojo has  commented on being grossed out by some  of her friends Instagram pages and some  fans think she was pointing to Kenzie's  page after all Kenzie is younger than  Jojo but dresses much older than her who  do you think Jojo was referring to sound  off in the comments  Bryn rum fellow and Cameron bridges  Cameron bridges became an official  member of the ALDC during season seven  of Dance Moms and she quickly became  friends with Brynn rum fellow who joined  the cast in season six but their  friendship eventually turned sour due to  Brynn liking a comment on Instagram that  made fun of the Elise Cameron and the  girls moms retaliated online making a  bad situation worse  Cameron countered by calling Brynn fake  but according to Cameron she didn't  actually say that she explained that the  Dance Moms executives played around with  the footage making her look bad in the  process  either way the incident caused a rift  between Cameron and Brynn and the rest  is pretty much history kendall vertes  and Cameron Bridges Kendall and Cameron  were never the best of friends but at  one point they got along just fine but  as season seven came to a close Kendall  and Cameron started bumping heads  Cameron Chloe Kalani Kendall and Nia  formed the irreplaceable but in 2017 the  group went on tour but didn't invite  Cameron to come along what was already a  shaky friendship took a turn for the  worst and Kendall and Cameron never  patched things up Maddie Ziegler and  Chloe Lucas yeah Maddie and Chloe were  the best of friends for as long as we  can remember  despite being pegged against each other  during their entire time on Dance Moms  the girls always found a way to support  each other and be kind 